/**
 * ⚠️ PLACEHOLDER OFFICE DATA WARNING ⚠️
 * - İstanbul (HQ) address comes from src/lib/brand.ts — verified.
 * - Abidjan + Rotterdam addresses + phones are PLACEHOLDERS ("Adres bilgisi
 *   yakında" / "Address coming soon" / "العنوان قريباً"). Previous iterations
 *   contained fabricated values (e.g. "Wilhelminakade 173" + fake +31 ... 555
 *   number). DO NOT REINTRODUCE invented contact data. Fill in from Koray
 *   when real office addresses & phones become available.
 *
 * ContactPage — faithful to Stitch design (4 editorial sections).
 *
 *   1. Hero            — "Let's connect across coordinates" with the
 *                        nautical-map / brass-compass image anchored right.
 *   2. Strategic Anchors — Bento of 4 office cards: Istanbul HQ (w/ satellite
 *                        view of Bosphorus), Abidjan origin hub (skyline overlay),
 *                        Rotterdam logistics tile (dark), and a world-map tile.
 *   3. Request a Custom Quote — sticky intro with feature bullets +
 *                        underline-style form (Name, Company Email, Commodity,
 *                        Quantity, Message).
 *   4. Commercial contact note — verified channels only.
 *
 * All 4 Stitch images are used (hero nautical map, Istanbul satellite,
 * Abidjan skyline, world map).
 */
